  "description": "Everything you've come to expect from Huntington Beach's premier beach cruiser brand — now in a streamlined single-speed package. The HBBC® Women's Beach Cruiser is built for riders who want proven performance, lasting quality, and head-turning style at an accessible price. The pedal-forward ergonomic frame puts you in a natural, upright riding position, and the single-speed coaster brake keeps things simple and reliable. Just pedal, cruise, and enjoy.26\" aluminum wheels, smooth ride cruiser tires, a gel comfort quiet-ride seat, and a heavy-duty built-in kickstand round out a package that's ready to ride from day one.Customize your ride with our bike accessories, or go further with our Electric Beach Cruisers.HBBC… Style Matters… Ride With Us!!Check out the entire HBBC® family of cruisers! Visit our flagship store — HB Easyrider at 328 Main Street in Downtown Huntington Beach!🛠️ Specs",
